#. module: bhs_sendgrid_mailer
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_bhs_sendgrid_mailer
msgid ""
"# BHSoft SendGrid Mailer\n"
"\n"
"## Overview\n"
"\n"
"`bhs_sendgrid_mailer` is a custom Odoo module for importing and processing bulk email through SendGrid. It provides a managed queue, randomized cumulative delays, delivery-status synchronization, duplicate filtering, and cancellation of scheduled messages.\n"
"\n"
"The module replaces the previous n8n and Google Sheets workflow so that imported data and delivery state remain available in Odoo.\n"
"\n"
"## Workflow\n"
"\n"
"### 1. Import recipients\n"
"\n"
"Use the **Import Excel File** wizard to load recipient data. The system recognizes English and Vietnamese headers for the recipient name, email, subject, body, and company. Each imported row receives a UUID and an import Batch ID.\n"
"\n"
"### 2. Validate and deduplicate\n"
"\n"
"Email addresses are validated during import and again before sending. Invalid addresses are marked as failed. When batch deduplication is enabled, repeated recipient addresses within the same import are marked as duplicate and are not sent.\n"
"\n"
"### 3. Process the outgoing queue\n"
"\n"
"The scheduled queue job processes a configurable number of pending messages per run. For every message, it adds a random delay between the configured minimum and maximum. These delays are cumulative, so the messages are scheduled at separate times.\n"
"\n"
"When a SendGrid API key is configured, the message is submitted directly to SendGrid with `send_at` and a SendGrid Batch ID. Without an API key, the module falls back to the Odoo mail queue.\n"
"\n"
"### 4. Synchronize status\n"
"\n"
"Odoo mail state can be synchronized by a scheduled job. Detailed SendGrid events can be received through the Event Webhook, queried through the SendGrid Activity API, or collected through both methods. Supported event states include processed, delivered, opened, clicked, bounced, dropped, and spam reports.\n"
"\n"
"Scheduled SendGrid messages with a Batch ID can be cancelled before their send time.\n"
"\n"
"## Configuration\n"
"\n"
"Administrators can configure:\n"
"\n"
"- the SendGrid API key and sender email;\n"
"- webhook and API polling status updates;\n"
"- the API polling interval and lookback period;\n"
"- duplicate filtering for each import batch;\n"
"- scheduled queue processing and Odoo status synchronization;\n"
"- batch size;\n"
"- minimum and maximum delay between messages.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: bhs_sendgrid_mailer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bhs_sendgrid_mailer.view_bhsoft_mail_queue_import_form
msgid ""
"* The Excel file must have a header row. The system automatically recognizes these columns:<br/>\n"
"                    <b>Contact, Email, Subject, Body, HubSpot ID, LinkedIn, Company, Company Website</b>.<br/>\n"
"                    The template may also contain <b>No., Sending Status, Sent date, Sent time</b>; these operational columns are ignored during import.<br/>\n"
"                    * Each imported row receives a unique UUID. When batch deduplication is enabled, only the first row for an email remains pending; later rows with the same normalized email are marked <b>Duplicate / Skipped</b> and are not sent."
msgstr ""

